      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ATOMIC TIGER (5) was below best at his last start when 8th at this track following a win (19.34) there two back. Form here at the trip excellent including six wins. Can make amends. BUTTERNUT QUEEN (3) broke from the inside draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 1.3 lengths (19.84) behind Unstable Mable at this track. Ready to find winning form. CAMBLA BLAZE (1) had been in great form but was out of the placings last run, finishing fourth (24.14) in a Grade 4 at Rockhampton. Generally a safe beginner but buried in the ruck from a squeeze draw last time. Comes out of a solid form race last start. One of the better chances. SWIFT CANNON (8) was in the money last time at this track (19.82) in a Grade 5, finishing a 1.5 lengths third. Has an unbeaten record from this draw, scoring two times.",
